# Over 536870912x32768x32768 CTAs of 32 threads, 2^64 threads leave
# i64: the instruction and warp instruction counts over the launch are
# unknown, but thread 0 of each CTA stores 4 B, 2^61 B in all.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/lane0_store.ptx --grid 536870912,32768,32768 | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: totals per launch [static]:
CHECK: instructions = 0 + unknown, warp instructions = 0 + unknown
CHECK: global bytes: load 0 B, store 2305843009213693952 B
# micro_lane0_copy's thread 0 loads and stores 8 B: 2^62 B each way,
# whose sum leaves i64 but is no overflow in its AI.
CHECK: kernel micro_lane0_copy
CHECK: totals per launch [static]:
CHECK: global bytes: load 4611686018427387904 B, store 4611686018427387904 B
CHECK: AI(global) = 0 flop/B
